# Zero Time Dilemma (PCSE00781): user's save, title > Load Game > slot 1 > "Load save?" (the game's own dialog, NO is
# preselected: left, then cross) > story text
# run: VitaSharp.Desktop --data=<root> run PCSE00781 --headless --nav=tests/nav/ztd_load.nav
wait 600
press cross
wait 900
shot title
press cross
wait 300
press cross
wait 120
shot dialog
press left
wait 30
press cross
wait 1200
shot story
quit
